Files in this folder are from pcre2-10.49

Original source archives are available from
<https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2/releases>

Only the library sources are kept: the test and command line programs, the
POSIX wrapper and the sljit dependency (used only by the JIT, which is not
enabled) are left out.

  include/pcre2.h          is src/pcre2.h.generic
  src/pcre2_chartables.c   is src/pcre2_chartables.c.dist
  src/config.h             is src/config.h.generic with these defined:
                             HAVE_ASSERT_H HAVE_INTTYPES_H HAVE_LIMITS_H
                             HAVE_STDINT_H HAVE_STDIO_H HAVE_STDLIB_H
                             HAVE_STRING_H PCRE2_STATIC SUPPORT_PCRE2_16
                             SUPPORT_UNICODE

The library is built for 16-bit code units only, so everything that compiles
or includes these files must define PCRE2_CODE_UNIT_WIDTH=16 (and
HAVE_CONFIG_H=1 when compiling them).
